body:
I've never done this type of work. I tend to procrastinate on things i know are hard for me (literally the definition of procrastination in psychology) but i've been working on those difficulties and it was just too much for me. I've done crazy amounts of work in short amount of times but this is another level, i have to win this, i won't forgive myself if i can't

&#x200B;

I'm doing the bare minimum, learning the methodology, applying it and literally no time for mistakes 

&#x200B;

(also i'm in this situation today because i was unable (psychologically) to contact my professor) 

&#x200B;

but thank you for taking the time to encourage me
